  <description value="Defines the AuditEvent Subtype for De-Identification events.&#xA;This is used to indicate that the AuditEvent is specifically for a De-Identification event.&#xA;The code is based on the ISO 21089 lifecycle code for de-identification."/>
  <jurisdiction>
